    description: Some("Two Namco arcade conversions on one cartridge. In Galaga a Boss Galaga can catch one of your fighters in its tractor beam, and winning that ship back joins it to yours as a twin-cannon Dual Fighter, with Challenging Stages breaking up the waves. Galaxian is the plainer of the pair — one ship, one laser cannon, against the swarm."),
